# quickshell-desktop
# earlyoom's options (man earlyoom), kept by the desktop's task manager:
# its Memory tab rewrites this file, and install.sh leaves it alone.
#
# As install.sh first puts it: SIGTERM once available memory and free swap
# are both at 10% or below, SIGKILL at 5%; no hourly report in the journal
# (-r 0). Spared (300 off their score): the compositor, Xwayland, the shell
# and the sound server, whose loss ends the session or silences it. Taken
# first: a browser's tab processes, whose loss is one tab.
EARLYOOM_ARGS="-r 0 -m 10,5 -s 10,5 --avoid ^(Hyprland|Xwayland|qs|pipewire|wireplumber)$ --prefer ^(Web[[:space:]]Content|Isolated[[:space:]]Web[[:space:]]Co)$"
